#: processes/initialize-harness.bpmn:62
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Ask the location, not your memory of it: a Knowledge Graph Data Store that carries a declaration at its root is ALREADY a layer, and it says so itself. `<name>.json` present and parsing is the whole test, and `bootstrap-kg-navigation` says what the three answers mean — absent (not a layer yet), present, and present-but-unreadable, which is a layer asserting something broken and is not a green light either. Done before reading the chosen harness: a location held by another harness ends the process here."
msgstr ""

