#: processes/initialize-harness.bpmn:34
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Everything this process performs other than reading the target location. The one judgement — WHICH harness — is not made here: it is the Requestor's, obtained inside `discussion` through `human-agent-discussion`, which is why this diagram has no Requestor lane. It follows the CHOSEN harness's own instructions rather than any bootstrap holds."
msgstr ""

